      'Which of the following composition justifies the secondary alkyl halide?',
      'R\u2082CHX. In a secondary (2\u00b0) alkyl halide, the halogen-bearing carbon is bonded to two other carbons and one H. R\u2083CX = tertiary; RCH\u2082X = primary; CH\u2083X = methyl.',
