      'Write the equation and give the name of major product: (i) Oxidation of acetone with acidified K\u2082Cr\u2082O\u2087 (ii) Reduction of acetaldehyde with NaBH\u2084 (iii) Hydration of ethyne with H\u2082SO\u2084/HgSO\u2084 (iv) Acylation of benzene with AlCl\u2083.',
